msgctxt "288"
msgid ""
"Hello, sir. This is your first time here, right? Then allow me to explain "
"the rules."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Oil Massage is a minigame where you mash buttons to keep the gauge from "
"going past the top or the bottom. If it does, you lose the game."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"The gauge is divided into five parts. The higher the gauge goes, the more "
"points you earn. Go for the most points possible by keeping the gauge as "
"high as you can without letting it go past the top or the bottom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"If you make it to the end without letting the gauge go past the top or "
"bottom, the Finish Gauge appears on the center of the screen. You win if "
"you fill up this gauge before time runs out. Note that the gauge is harder "
"to fill if you scored too few points earlier."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "Okay, which massage would you like?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
